        "cooked": "<p>The bot is updated to Onslaught:</p>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://global.discourse-cdn.com/eveonline/original/3X/0/2/02123662fa0cb4b24d66ca35bb68e9b21cf51e56.jpeg\" title=\"kikimora.jpg\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\"><img src=\"https://global.discourse-cdn.com/eveonline/optimized/3X/0/2/02123662fa0cb4b24d66ca35bb68e9b21cf51e56_2_267x500.jpeg\" alt=\"kikimora\" data-base62-sha1=\"ijYrDblXBNg9ybPGcQZQc0unc2\" width=\"267\" height=\"500\" srcset=\"https://global.discourse-cdn.com/eveonline/optimized/3X/0/2/02123662fa0cb4b24d66ca35bb68e9b21cf51e56_2_267x500.jpeg, https://global.discourse-cdn.com/eveonline/optimized/3X/0/2/02123662fa0cb4b24d66ca35bb68e9b21cf51e56_2_400x750.jpeg 1.5x, https://global.discourse-cdn.com/eveonline/original/3X/0/2/02123662fa0cb4b24d66ca35bb68e9b21cf51e56.jpeg 2x\" data-small-upload=\"https://global.discourse-cdn.com/eveonline/optimized/3X/0/2/02123662fa0cb4b24d66ca35bb68e9b21cf51e56_2_10x10.png\"><div class=\"meta\">\n<svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use xlink:href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">kikimora.jpg</span><span class=\"informations\">452×844 86.2 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use xlink:href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg>\n</div></a></div></p>",
